     A** EDI - R21 Format File                                        *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A**
     A          R PN001                     TEXT('EDI Transmission Data')
     A            N0CO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            N0FND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            N0FYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            N0CASE    R               REFFLD(CASE)
     A            N0MTC     R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      TEXT('MTC')
     A                                      COLHDG('MTC')
     A            N0TSET    R               REFFLD(DS3)
     A                                      TEXT('Transaction set ID')
     A                                      COLHDG('Transaction set ID')
     A            N0CXRC    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      TEXT('Cancel Reason Code')
     A                                      COLHDG('Cancel Reason Code')
     A            N0JRC#        25A         TEXT('Jurisdiction Claim Number')
     A                                      COLHDG('Jurisdiction' +
     A                                             'Claim Number')
     A            N0CRNA       150A         TEXT('Cancel Reason Narrative')
     A                                      COLHDG('Cancel Reason' +
     A                                             'Narative')
